    "title": "Question 1: Discovering the Paradox",
    "subtitle": "Part I: The Committee's Dilemma - Building Intuition (45 minutes)",
    "read_html": "<h3>Scenario Setup: The European Climate Council</h3>\n<p>You're observing the European Climate Council, a 9-member body deciding on three climate policy packages:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Package G (Green New Deal):</strong> Aggressive emissions cuts, massive public investment</li>\n<li><strong>Package M (Market Solutions):</strong> Carbon pricing, private sector incentives</li>\n<li><strong>Package I (Incremental Steps):</strong> Gradual transition, minimal disruption</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The council has three factions of 3 members each:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Progressives:</strong> G &gt; M &gt; I</li>\n<li><strong>Market Liberals:</strong> M &gt; I &gt; G</li>\n<li><strong>Conservatives:</strong> I &gt; G &gt; M</li>\n</ul>",
