      "label": "Part F1: The One-Dimensional Version",
      "kind": "DRAW",
      "prompt_html": "<h3>Part F: The Heresthetic Reframing</h3>\n<p><strong>[READ] The Strategic Rewind:</strong> Let's go back in time. Initially, the Climate Council debate was much simpler - it was only about \"How much to spend on renewable energy?\"</p>\n<p><strong>[DRAW] Part F1: The One-Dimensional Version</strong> On a line from €0 to €100 billion for renewables:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Environmental Bloc ideal: €75 billion</li>\n<li>Tech Bloc ideal: €30 billion</li>\n<li>Skeptic Bloc ideal: €25 billion</li>\n<li>Status Quo: €40 billion</li>\n<li>Mark all positions</li>\n<li>Identify the median voter: _____</li>\n<li>With pure majority rule, equilibrium outcome: €_____</li>\n</ul>",
      "answer_b64": "",
