      "kind": "WRITE",
      "prompt_html": "<h3>Part G: Synthesis and Reflection</h3>\n<p><strong>[WRITE] Part G1: Institutional Design</strong> (4-5 sentences) Compare the outcomes under:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pure majority rule (chaos but democratic)</li>\n<li>One veto player (constrained but biased)</li>\n<li>Two veto players (contract curve)</li>\n<li>Three veto players (near paralysis)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Which institutional arrangement would you recommend for the Climate Council and why? What values are you prioritizing?</p>",
