      "label": "Part C",
      "kind": "DO",
      "prompt_html": "<p>Then, do the same exercise for both rules (using a dashed line on the two axes already created), assuming that the legislature operates on the principal of zero-based budgeting, so if no bill is passed in the current session, the policy reverts to ZB = 0.</p>",
